# .git-blame-ignore-revs
# Contains commits that should be ignored in git blame.
# Useful for large formatting/refactoring commits.
#
# Usage: git blame --ignore-revs-file .git-blame-ignore-revs <file>
# Or configure in gitconfig: git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs

